{"v":4,"catch":"一顆神秘的隕石墜落在亞利桑那州的大峽谷。","desc":"考古學家趕到墜機現場檢查太空岩石，但整個團隊都失蹤了。 \n你和你的姪女艾瑪是搜索隊的成員。 你來到荒涼的營地尋找線索，突然，隕石將你傳送到了另一個宇宙！ \n現在你必須探索迷人的光與影世界，尋找隱藏的文物，並解決謎題以找到考古學家。 \n你肯定會在冒險中得到幫助，但請記住最重要的事情 - 並非所有友好的陌生人實際上都可以成為你的朋友！","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2024-02-15","genres":["冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/271ead3293848538f14fbb3291e4f0a9b499c5dec6d9cab59dab40fffd2c5e55.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ebc66f4d17fb0a6b31b423c38a0d4bdb7d6fb00f62aae1bcaa8e9ce5dea39dd0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/146fde40731a10cd5c29a800bf0d26ca0d180f46f8866da61afe572a411647c2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f025c227c3ac3f5ef7619ecdaf0eeee087de9214ac3b3c0485100d2781e29ccb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe4758bc7cb4e6ac36917a09f459f6b171d58291c89ac431289ac31e05a1c087.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9fc79d105c3eba2ce9ebc009c702d24dacf16a929fefe9b667cd39f48b069ddb.jpg"],"titleId":"01000c601d37a000","dlc":[]}